EN:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}I've been spending a little too much
money lately,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} so if you could not tell
anyone you saw me here{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}

{{TAG:0003:0025:}}You seem like a very smart shopper.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}So which floor is your favorite,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}?

